A measurable set such that `μ.restrict (μ.sigmaFiniteSetGE ν n)` is sigma-finite and
for `C` the supremum of `ν s` over all measurable sets `s` with `μ.restrict s` sigma-finite,
`ν (μ.sigmaFiniteSetGE ν n) ≥ C - 1/n`.

